      </dl>
    </div>
    <p>
      <span class="wl-ko">개인정보 침해에 대한 신고나 상담은 개인정보침해신고센터(국번 없이 118, <a href="https://privacy.kisa.or.kr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy.kisa.or.kr</a>), 개인정보분쟁조정위원회(1833-6972, <a href="https://www.kopico.go.kr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">kopico.go.kr</a>)에도 할 수 있습니다.</span>
      <span class="wl-en">You can also contact the Korea Internet & Security Agency privacy center (118, <a href="https://privacy.kisa.or.kr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy.kisa.or.kr</a>) or the Personal Information Dispute Mediation Committee (1833-6972, <a href="https://www.kopico.go.kr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">kopico.go.kr</a>).</span>
    </p>

